-# Response to a pagination_sentinel fetch: it replaces the previous
-# sentinel frame with this page's cards followed by a fresh sentinel for
-# the next page (or nothing, if this was the last page), chaining the
-# infinite scroll one page at a time.
= turbo_frame_tag(:agenda_events_list_page) do
  = render "event_cards"
  = render "pagination_sentinel"
